 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The hand of the Lord came upon me in a vision",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 18.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Set me down in a valley full of bones, no living",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 20.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Very many, very dry, sun bleached, forgotten",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 53.5,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He said, son of man, can these bones live again",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 56.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I said, Lord, you know, I can't answer that",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 61.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He said, prophesy to the bones, tell them this is a fact",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 78.02,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Hear the word of the Lord, I will breathe into you",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 81.28,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Put flesh on your frame and you will live, it's true",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 80.89,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Dry bones rise, dry bones rise",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 78.24,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Hear the word of the Lord tonight",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 70.77,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Breath from the four winds, come alive",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 65.35,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Dry bones rise",
   "heard": 1,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 58.75,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So I prophesied and there was a rattling sound",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 55.31,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Bone came to bone all over the ground",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 52.61,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Sinews and flesh and the skin on top",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 49.47,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But no breath in them yet, so the story didn't stop",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 47.28,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Prophesy to the breath, come from the four winds",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 44.19,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Breathe on the slain, let them live again",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 41.27,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And the breath came in and they stood on their feet",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 38.47,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "A vast great army, the valley complete",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 35.68,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
